      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "OLLIES THE BOSS (8) led last start and finished second in a far better performance at Melton over 2240m, beaten a neck. Shouldn't spend a penny from this draw and the sprint lane may come in handy. Has the talent to take care of this field. KING SAINT (4) finished second at Melton two runs ago before making up plenty of ground after having raced six back on the fence at the bell but finding one better at his latest appearance over 1690m at this track. Tackles a similar assignment and he can give this a mighty shake. KIA ORA BEAUTY (5) is on the radar after her last-start fourth over 1770m at Albury a week ago. Has won four of 16 runs at this track. WICKED MITZI (7) was thereabouts last time out at the second run back from a spell finishing fourth of seven over 2180m at Stawell. Open to plenty of improvement. Include in combinations.",
